### The Inbox card that asks you to allow the download of a Semantic Search model.
### The maintainer reviews every change to this file, in every language.

# What the request does: download a model for Semantic Search. $model is the model's name; $download is how many MB come down; $kept is how many MB stay on the disk.
consent-model-download = Download { $model }: { $download } MB to fetch, { $kept } MB kept on this Mac
